er_with_no_shipments` — Verifies order transitions to CANCELLED status\n- `cancels_CREATED_shipments_when_cancelling_an_order` — Verifies CREATED shipments also transition to CANCELLED\n- `returns_409_when_cancelling_order_with_CONFIRMED_shipment_and_changes_nothing` — Verifies all-or-nothing constraint\n- `cancelling_an_already_cancelled_order_succeeds_idempotent` — Verifies idempotent retry behavior\n- `returns_404_when_cancelling_non_existent_order` — Verifies 404 for missing order\n- `newly_created_order_has_ACTIVE_status` — Verifies default status is ACTIVE\n- `returns_409_when_creating_shipment_for_cancelled_order` — Verifies shipment creation blocked for cancelled orders\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from sample-service/, result: BUILD SUCCESS with 20 tests passing (0 failures, 0 errors)\n\nNot done: Nothing. All acceptance criteria implemented and verified."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3329,"cache_read_input_tokens":31755,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3329},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"760974bc-3412-4587-b6fe-2bdd90b44f14","uuid":"ed7f1320-fcdc-4ccc-9af3-bff278603cd6","timestamp":"2026-09-26T19:28:09.799Z","request_id":"req_011CfSbuBNDBUuPMSGxfFtUv"}
